From a5d5689897ad543187f11cadafb1a4939dc9ec32 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 18:16:17 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] NetInflow: carry no local variable across @synchronize in
 the net-inflow pin

On the CPU, KernelAbstractions splits a kernel at @synchronize, so locals
assigned before it are undefined after it (UndefVarError: Ny in
_pin_net_barotropic_inflow!). Read grid.Nx, grid.Ny and the side weights
where they are used, as _pin_barotropic_face! already does. GPU runs were
not affected.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Abhhvkp8Pai9cvvctGUDX5
